 "\n"
}], "Usage",ExpressionUUID->"b8433dd8-24a3-4b61-b172-dbe2772686f6"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Definition: a ",
 StyleBox["k", "TI"],
 "-cochain takes its values on the (",
 StyleBox["k", "TI"],
 " + 1)-cliques of a graph, the ",
 StyleBox["k", "TI"],
 "-simplices of its clique complex, and ",
 StyleBox["k", "TI"],
 " is its degree."
}], "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"891774cc-89fd-40c1-8809-ab28d16e6a69"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "A ",
 StyleBox["k", "TI"],
 "-cochain is stored as ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{"<|", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"{", 
     RowBox[{"v0", ",", " ", "...", ",", " ", "vk"}], "}"}], " ", "->", " ", 
    "value"}], "|>"}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "eb442ee9-f76a-488f-af03-dec33189fa7c"],
 " on the sorted cliques, and the degree is read off the first key."
}], "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"e8ed6566-9085-43c5-a142-bfe6c550d79c"],

